For production, set `initialize-schema: false` after the initial setup and manage schema changes with Flyway or Liquibase. The Spring AI PGVector docs note that schema initialization must be explicitly enabled; older versions behaved differently. ([docs.spring.io](https://docs.spring.io/spring-ai/reference/api/vectordbs/pgvector.html?utm_source=openai))

