## 6. Domain model

Create a normalized chat request object:

```java
public record ChatRequest(
        String conversationId,
        String userId,
        String message,
        List<UploadedInput> inputs
) {}

public record UploadedInput(
        String inputId,
        InputType type,
        String fileName,
        String contentType,
        String storageUrl
) {}

public enum InputType {
    PDF,
    CSV,
    IMAGE,
    SERVICE_RESPONSE,
    TEXT
}
```

Define the router output:

```java
public record RouteDecision(
        RouteTarget target,
        boolean useRag,
        boolean requiresToolCall,
        String reason,
        double confidence
) {}

public enum RouteTarget {
    GENERAL_QA,
    DOCUMENT_QA,
    ORDER_SERVICE,
    CUSTOMER_SERVICE,
    BILLING_SERVICE,
    REPORT_GENERATION,
    HUMAN_HANDOFF,
    UNSUPPORTED
}
```

