## 14. Image ingestion

For images, you have two options:

### Option A — OCR/vision extraction, then RAG

```text
Image → OCR or vision model → extracted text → chunks → embeddings → vector DB
```

Use this for:

```text
scanned PDFs
receipts
screenshots
forms
diagrams with text
```

### Option B — Multimodal chat

```text
User sends image → send image directly to multimodal model → answer
```

Use this for:

```text
visual reasoning
image description
UI screenshot understanding
damage inspection
chart interpretation
```

Spring AI has a multimodality API for sending media with messages to supported models. ([docs.spring.io](https://docs.spring.io/spring-ai/reference/api/multimodality.html?utm_source=openai))

For RAG, however, most production systems still convert image content to **text + metadata** before embedding, because vector retrieval is usually text-centric.

