## 20. RAG quality recommendations

Use this as your default:

```text
Chunk size:        300–800 tokens
Chunk overlap:     50–150 tokens
Top K:             4–8 chunks
Similarity cutoff: tune experimentally
Metadata filters:  always
Reranking:         add later for quality
Citations:         include source title/page when possible
```

Add metadata like:

```java
metadata.put("page", pageNumber);
metadata.put("section", sectionTitle);
metadata.put("sourceUrl", sourceUrl);
metadata.put("fileName", fileName);
```

Then instruct the model:

```text
Use the provided context only.
If the answer is not in the context, say you do not know.
When possible, cite the document name and page.
```

