## 21. Security checklist

For production, implement:

```text
Authentication:          OAuth2/JWT/session auth
Authorization:           tenant/user-level access checks
Metadata filtering:      tenantId, userId, document visibility
File scanning:           antivirus/malware scanning
Content-type validation: never trust file extensions
File size limits:        prevent abuse
Prompt injection guard:  treat retrieved docs as untrusted content
PII redaction:           where needed
Secrets protection:      never send secrets to the model
Audit logs:              every route/tool/action
Rate limiting:           per user and tenant
Human approval:          for destructive actions
```

Especially with RAG, remember: documents may contain malicious instructions such as “ignore previous instructions.” Your system prompt should explicitly say retrieved documents are **data**, not instructions.

