## 25. The key rule: RAG vs service calls

Use this decision table:

| User asks about | Best approach |
|---|---|
| Company policy | RAG |
| PDF/manual/contract content | RAG |
| Uploaded CSV explanation | RAG + structured parsing |
| Current order status | Service call |
| Invoice balance | Service call |
| Generate report | Service call + LLM summary |
| Analyze screenshot | Vision model/OCR |
| Search across documents | RAG |
| Perform an action | Tool/service call with validation |

RAG should answer from knowledge. Tools/services should handle live state and actions.

