## 26. Minimal production-ready flow

The ideal chat flow is:

```java
public ChatResponseDto handle(ChatRequest request) {

    validateUserAccess(request);

    normalizeInputs(request);

    RouteDecision route = intentRouter.route(request);

    route = routeDecisionValidator.validate(route, request);

    auditRouteDecision(request, route);

    if (route.target() == RouteTarget.DOCUMENT_QA) {
        return answerWithRag(request, route);
    }

    if (isBusinessService(route.target())) {
        ServiceResult result = dispatcher.dispatch(route, request);
        return composeFinalResponse(request, result);
    }

    return fallback(request);
}
```

